lected the existing biological fossils and determined their dates. It does not provide any information about whether fossils of different species found in the same place belong to different periods or not.\n\nC) The method of determining the date of beetles is more accurate than that of other organisms.\n- This assumption is not explicitly stated in the context. The context only mentions that the research team selected the existing biological fossils and determined their dates. It does not provide any information about the accuracy of the method used to determine the date of beetles compared to other organisms.\n\nD) In the past 22,000 years, the tolerable temperature of beetles has not changed significantly.\n- This assumption is explicitly stated in the context. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
