messages:   27%|##7       | 163/600 [00:53<03:06,  2.34it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe application of the law refers to the specialized activities of the state judiciary organs to deal with cases by applying the law in accordance with the statutory powers and procedures.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following acts is the application of the law?\n# Options:\nA) The customs officer thought zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to wang mou's act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\nC) According to relevant national  and regulations of law, li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.. I think the correct option is: D\n", "<think>.\nTo determine which option represents the application of the law, we need to analyze each option and see if it involves the judiciary organs applying the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures.\n\nA) The customs officer thought Zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\n- This option describes a customs officer's suspicion and investigation, but it does not involve the judiciary organs applying the law. It is more of an investigative action by a customs officer.\n\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to Wang Mou's act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\n- This option describes the procuratorial organ conducting an investigation based on a populace report. While it involves the judiciary organs, it does not necessarily involve the application of the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures. It is more of an investigative action by the procuratorial organ.\n\nC) According to relevant national and regulations of law, Li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\n- This option describes a legal transaction between two parties, where Li signs a house sales contract. It does not involve the judiciary organs applying the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures. It is more of a contractual action between two parties.\n\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.\n- This option describes a meeting convened by the public security bureau director to discuss improving the quality of police handling cases. It does not involve the judiciary organs applying the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures. It is more of a policy-making action by the public security bureau director.\n\nBased on the analysis, none of the options directly represent the application of the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
