hat are stored in a dry, sheltered place.**.\n   - This statement weakens the argument because it suggests that the organic matter could have accumulated much more recently than 1,000 years ago. If the organic matter could have formed much more recently, then the monument might not be as old as previously thought.\n\nC) **The Andean monument bears a striking resemblance to monuments found in ancient sites in Western Asia.**.\n   - This statement does not directly weaken the argument because it does not provide any information about the age of the monument. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
