mutant fungi. Therefore, this option is not supported by the context.\n\nB) Human space activities may lead to the spread of space microbes to earth.\n- This option suggests that human space activities may lead to the spread of space microbes to earth. The context mentions that space microbes could pose a threat to humans if they return to Earth and escape destruction, which implies that human space activities may indeed lead to the spread of space microbes to earth. Therefore, this option is supported by the context.\n\nC) With the increase of human space activities, space junk has affected human life.\n- This option suggests that the increase of human space activities has affected human life. However, the context only mentions that space microbes could pose a threat to humans if they return to Earth and escape destruction, but it does not explicitly state that the increase of human space activities has affected human life. Therefore, this option is not supported by the context.\n\nD) Space mutant fungi will be the deadliest threat to mankind.\n- This option suggests that space mutant fungi will be the deadliest threat to mankind. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
