ciety on interpersonal relationships.\n\nNow, let's examine each option:.\n\nA) Benefits for the financial industry: The context mentions that a cashless society will help to lower the threshold of financial services and better promote economic development. This suggests that the financial industry benefits from a cashless society.\n\nB) The reason why it has attracted a lot of attention: The context explains that the rapid development of mobile payment has attracted people's attention, covering various aspects of life and making some people change their habit of using cash. This indicates that the reason for its attention is related to the development of mobile payment.\n\nC) Relationship with currency issuance: The context mentions that a cashless society will help to reduce the utilization rate and management costs of cash, which will accelerate the flow of funds. This implies that there is a relationship between a cashless society and currency issuance. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
