ned to the same department. Since F is in the production department, H and Y must be in the same department as well.\n- **Condition 2:** F and G cannot be assigned to the same department. Since F is in the production department, G cannot be in the production department.\n- **Condition 3:** If X is assigned to the sales department, W is assigned to the production department. Since F is in the production department, X cannot be in the sales department, so W must be in the production department.\n\nNow, let's analyze the options:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
