rew a cigarette butt on the sofa and caused a fire. This act does not meet the criteria for arson because Mr. Gao did not set fire on a condition that he knew it would cause losses to others, the state, or collective property.\n\nD) Feeling unbearable in this situation, Mr. Bao was filled with gasoline and set fire to himself in the downtown area. This act does not meet the criteria for arson because Mr. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
