This means if someone did not get the full vote, Li Zilu also ticked them.\n\n4. **Applying the Deductions:**.\n   - Let's assume Zhao Jie was ticked by someone (let's call them Candidate X).\n   - Since Wang Ming checked all those who checked Zhao Jie, Wang Ming also ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Since Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote, if Zhao Jie did not get the full vote, Li Zilu also ticked Zhao Jie.\n\n5. **Conclusion:**.\n   - If Zhao Jie was ticked by someone, both Wang Ming and Li Zilu ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Therefore, Wang Ming and Li Zilu ticked each other.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is:.\n<｜User｜>Based on the above information, from this it follows that:.\n# Options:.\nA) Wang ming and li zilu didn't tick each other.\nB) Wang ming and li zilu ticked each other.\nC) Wang ming chose li zilu, but li zilu didn't choose wang ming.\nD) Wang ming didn't choose li zilu, but li zilu chose wang ming.\n<｜Assistant｜>. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
