 parts of the country. Therefore, this statement could be true.\n\nD) It is impossible to grow cyclamen in this country.\n- This statement must be false based on the given information. The context states that cyclamen is easy to grow in most parts of the country, which means it is possible to grow cyclamen in some parts of the country. Therefore, it is not impossible to grow cyclamen in this country. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
