messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe cultural industry integrates intensive talent, technology, knowledge and capital, and has distinct cross-disciplinary, cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space and cross-cultural characteristics. It will also play a central role in future personal behavior, social life and nation-building, as well as global development and human affairs. Report of the World Commission on Culture and Development of the United Nations Scientific, Educational and Cultural Organization in 1995. It is pointed out that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. It can be said that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture put forward fundamental requirements for the high quality and scale of cultural talents.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life\nB) Cultural talents should have high quality and scale\nC) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development\nD) The particularity and importance of cultural industry. I think the correct option is: D\n', "<think>.\nTo determine the main content of the text, I will analyze the key points and themes presented in the context. The text discusses the cultural industry's characteristics, its role in human life, and its importance in achieving overall prosperity and development. It also mentions the United Nations Scientific, Educational and Cultural Organization's report on the significance of culture. Based on these points, the main content of the text appears to be the importance of culture and the cultural industry in achieving overall prosperity and development. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
