messages:   99%|#########9| 594/600 [03:49<00:01,  5.21it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPeople may be divided into two classes: those who are a little ambitious and those who are not. For ordinary people, a little ambition is a firm motivation to pull them out of their ordinary lives. Without that ambition, can only be powerless and even ignorant, slowly submerged by the ordinary life. In times of change, that bit of ambition can lead to spectacular results.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following statements constitutes a rebuttal to the above statement?\n# Options:\nA) Liu bei, who made straw sandals, never forgot that he was the emperor's uncle.because of this, he went from empty-handed to one-third of the world.\nB) Although zhang xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence. he worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\nC) Liu qin has neither ambition nor special talent, just by virtue of her natural beauty and the help of noble people in her life, she has accomplished many things.\nD) The chrysanthemum elder sister is neither talented nor beautiful, but she thinks highly of herself, constantly toss about, life also lead a prosperous life.. I think the correct option is: D\n", "<think>.\nTo determine which statement constitutes a rebuttal to the given statement, we need to analyze each option and see if it provides evidence that contradicts the idea that a little ambition can lead to spectacular results. Let's break down each option:.\n\nA) Liu Bei: This option suggests that Liu Bei's ambition led to his success despite his humble beginnings. However, this does not directly contradict the idea that a little ambition can lead to spectacular results because it shows that even someone with little ambition can achieve great things through hard work and determination.\n\nB) Zhang Xiong: This option states that Zhang Xiong had high ambitions but was mediocre in intelligence and did not achieve anything significant. This directly contradicts the idea that a little ambition can lead to spectacular results because it shows that even with high ambition, lack of intelligence can hinder success.\n\nC) Liu Qin: This option suggests that Liu Qin's lack of ambition and special talent led to her success. This does not directly contradict the idea that a little ambition can lead to spectacular results because it shows that even someone without ambition can achieve success through other means.\n\nD) The Chrysanthemum Elder Sister: This option suggests that the Chrysanthemum Elder Sister's lack of talent and beauty led to her success. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
